---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import '../styles/pages/careers.css';
---

<MainLayout title="Careers at Nyx Solution — Build Agentic AI Systems" description="Join Nyx Solution to build production agentic AI systems for ERP, TallyPrime, SAP, and complex business operations. Now hiring frontend and backend developers with 2–3 years of experience.">
  <div class="careers-page">
    <nav class="career-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <div class="career-container career-nav-inner">
        <a class="career-brand" href="/">Nyx Solution</a>
        <div class="career-nav-links">
          <a href="/#what-we-do">Agentic AI</a>
          <a href="/products">Products</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a class="active" href="/careers">Careers</a>
        </div>
        <a class="career-nav-cta" href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <main>
      <section class="career-hero">
        <div class="career-container career-hero-grid">
          <div class="career-hero-copy">
            <p class="career-eyebrow"><span></span>Careers at Nyx Solution</p>
            <h1>Build AI systems that do <em>real work.</em></h1>
            <p class="career-lead">Join a product-focused engineering team building agentic AI for finance, operations, ERP, TallyPrime, SAP, and other business-critical workflows.</p>
            <div class="career-actions">
              <a class="career-btn career-btn-primary" href="#open-roles">View open roles</a>
              <a class="career-btn career-btn-secondary" href="mailto:team@nyxsolution.in?subject=Careers%20at%20Nyx%20Solution">Email our team</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class="hiring-panel" aria-label="Current hiring status">
            <div class="hiring-panel-head">
              <span class="hiring-live"><i></i>Now hiring</span>
              <span>Engineering</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hiring-count">02</div>
            <p>Open engineering roles</p>
            <div class="hiring-role-row">
              <span>Frontend Developer</span>
              <strong>2–3 years</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="hiring-role-row">
              <span>Backend Developer</span>
              <strong>2–3 years</strong>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="why-section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
        <div class="career-container">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="career-kicker">Why Nyx Solution</p>
            <h2 id="why-title">A place to build deeply, learn quickly, and own the outcome</h2>
            <p>We are building products for operational problems where reliability, clarity, and thoughtful engineering matter.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="benefit-grid">
            <article class="benefit-card">
              <span class="benefit-number">01</span>
              <h3>Work on meaningful problems</h3>
              <p>Build systems that reduce manual work, improve financial operations, and help teams make better decisions.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="benefit-card">
              <span class="benefit-number">02</span>
              <h3>Build production agentic AI</h3>
              <p>Go beyond demos and chat interfaces. Work on agents, approvals, exception handling, integrations, and verified system actions.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="benefit-card">
              <span class="benefit-number">03</span>
              <h3>Own complete product outcomes</h3>
              <p>Contribute from problem framing and architecture through implementation, testing, and product improvement.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="benefit-card">
              <span class="benefit-number">04</span>
              <h3>Learn across disciplines</h3>
              <p>Work closely with product, design, AI, business workflows, and integrations instead of staying inside a narrow task list.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="benefit-card">
              <span class="benefit-number">05</span>
              <h3>Direct collaboration</h3>
              <p>Communicate closely with the people making product and engineering decisions, with context around why the work matters.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="benefit-card">
              <span class="benefit-number">06</span>
              <h3>Quality over shortcuts</h3>
              <p>We value clear thinking, maintainable systems, useful interfaces, careful testing, and software teams can trust.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="roles-section" id="open-roles" aria-labelledby="roles-title">
        <div class="career-container">
          <div class="section-heading role-heading">
            <p class="career-kicker">Open positions</p>
            <h2 id="roles-title">Help us build the operating layer for agentic AI</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="role-list">
            <article class="role-card">
              <div class="role-topline">
                <span class="role-index">01</span>
                <span class="role-status">Open</span>
              </div>
              <div class="role-title-row">
                <div>
                  <h3>Frontend Developer</h3>
                  <p>Build clear, responsive product experiences for complex operational workflows.</p>
                </div>
                <span class="experience-pill">2–3 years experience</span>
              </div>
              <div class="role-detail-grid">
                <div>
                  <h4>What you will work on</h4>
                  <ul>
                    <li>Operational dashboards, review queues, approval flows, and agent interfaces</li>
                    <li>Responsive, accessible web experiences connected to production APIs</li>
                    <li>Complex application state, data-heavy screens, and clear error handling</li>
                    <li>Reusable UI systems that make sophisticated workflows easy to understand</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>What we are looking for</h4>
                  <ul>
                    <li>2–3 years building and shipping production web applications</li>
                    <li>Strong JavaScript or TypeScript, HTML, CSS, and component-based UI skills</li>
                    <li>Experience integrating APIs and translating requirements into polished interfaces</li>
                    <li>Care for usability, performance, maintainability, and visual detail</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a class="role-apply" href="mailto:team@nyxsolution.in?subject=Application%20%E2%80%94%20Frontend%20Developer">Apply for Frontend Developer <span>↗</span></a>
            </article>

            <article class="role-card">
              <div class="role-topline">
                <span class="role-index">02</span>
                <span class="role-status">Open</span>
              </div>
              <div class="role-title-row">
                <div>
                  <h3>Backend Developer</h3>
                  <p>Build reliable services and integrations behind agentic business workflows.</p>
                </div>
                <span class="experience-pill">2–3 years experience</span>
              </div>
              <div class="role-detail-grid">
                <div>
                  <h4>What you will work on</h4>
                  <ul>
                    <li>APIs and services for document, finance, ERP, TallyPrime, and SAP workflows</li>
                    <li>Agent orchestration, business rules, approvals, queues, and exception handling</li>
                    <li>Secure data models, system connectors, monitoring, and audit histories</li>
                    <li>Integrations that turn approved AI recommendations into controlled actions</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h4>What we are looking for</h4>
                  <ul>
                    <li>2–3 years building and operating production backend systems</li>
                    <li>Strong API design, database fundamentals, authentication, testing, and debugging skills</li>
                    <li>Experience with a modern backend language and SQL-based data systems</li>
                    <li>A practical approach to reliability, security, observability, and maintainable architecture</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a class="role-apply" href="mailto:team@nyxsolution.in?subject=Application%20%E2%80%94%20Backend%20Developer">Apply for Backend Developer <span>↗</span></a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="application-section">
        <div class="career-container application-card">
          <div>
            <p class="career-kicker">Apply to Nyx Solution</p>
            <h2>Send us your profile and the work you are proud of</h2>
            <p>Email your résumé, relevant links, and the role you are applying for. A short note about what you want to build is always useful.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="application-contact">
            <span>Applications and questions</span>
            <a href="mailto:team@nyxsolution.in?subject=Careers%20at%20Nyx%20Solution">team@nyxsolution.in</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="career-footer">
      <div class="career-container career-footer-inner">
        <div>
          <strong>Nyx Solution</strong>
          <span>Agentic AI for real business operations</span>
        </div>
        <div class="career-footer-links">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="/products">Products</a>
          <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
        <span>© 2026 Nyx Solution</span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
